# ******************************************************************
# Program     : .gitignore
# Application : CardDemo
# Type        : Git exclusion rules (repository hygiene)
# Function    : Keeps locally generated build output, editor state,
#               runtime scratch and local secrets out of version
#               control, while leaving every migration deliverable -
#               and the whole frozen legacy corpus - fully visible.
# Source      : app/**, samples/** and diagrams/** @ 7756d89 - the
#               frozen reference trees that must reach every clone
#               intact; CONTRIBUTING.md, which asks that a change stay
#               focused and that local tests pass
